# Implementation Plan - Core Codebase Bug & Issue Cleanup

This plan resolves the 71 ESLint issues in the repository. It focuses on resolving React 19 state-in-effect issues, unescaped text entities, unused imports/variables, and explicit `any` types.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Component: Configurations & Shared Types

#### [MODIFY] [eslint.config.mjs](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/eslint.config.mjs)
- Exclude standalone JS scripts (such as database migrations and utility scripts) from compilation-level typescript/react linting rules.
- Add `*.js` and `scripts/**` to the `globalIgnores` array.

#### [MODIFY] [database.ts](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/types/database.ts)
- Add a shared `Feedback` interface to avoid utilizing `any` when mapping feedback records:
  ```typescript
  export interface Feedback {
    id: string;
    user_id: string;
    name: string;
    role: string;
    category: string;
    message: string;
    status: string;
    admin_reply: string | null;
    replied_at: string | null;
    created_at: string;
  }
  ```

