### Component: Core UI & PWA Features

#### [MODIFY] [Modal.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/components/ui/Modal.tsx)
- Resolve React 19 `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` warning.
- Wrap `setMounted(true)` inside a hydration-safe `setTimeout` callback in `useEffect` and clean up the timer.

#### [MODIFY] [InstallAppButton.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/components/pwa/InstallAppButton.tsx)
- Resolve `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` warning.
- Wrap `setIsStandalone` inside a deferred `setTimeout` callback to prevent synchronous render cascading on mount.

#### [MODIFY] [PWAInstallPrompt.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/components/pwa/PWAInstallPrompt.tsx)
- Resolve `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` warning.
- Replace synchronous `setIsIOS` call by lazy initializing `isIOS` via state initializer (since the prompt is not rendered during initial page hydration, this is safe and warning-free).
- Escape JSX quotes/apostrophes in prompt texts.

#### [MODIFY] [BadgeDisplay.tsx](file:///d:/TechPlatform/skillarena/src/components/shared/BadgeDisplay.tsx)
- Remove unused eslint-disable comment on line 29 since the component correctly uses Next's `<Image>` component instead of raw `<img>`.

